{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37261","headline":"题刑部李郎中山亭 · 秦韬玉","name":"题刑部李郎中山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侬家云水本相知，每到高斋强展眉。\n瘦竹嚲烟遮板阁，卷荷擎雨出盆池。\n笑吟山色同欹枕，闲背庭阴对覆碁。\n不是主人多野兴，肯开青眼重渔师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}